  "description": "Enjoy the peaceful and colorful nature views in incredible REAL 4K HDR 60FPS. Relax with beautiful birds like Toucans, Macaws, Flamingos and more!..  Music for relaxation, meditation, yoga, study. Sit back, relax and enjoy :)\n\nHelping you Relax with Stunning Nature in 4K, subscribe for more!:\n▷ http://bit.ly/Subscribe-Balu\n🔔Be sure to ring the bell to get EVERY new video notification! 🔔\n\nOur 4k Videos are great as a TV Screensaver for the living room, office, lounge, waiting room, Spa, Restaurant, etc. Play it in your Oled TV like the samsung S95B, LG c2, Smart TV, Roku, Apple tv, Chromecast, Xbox, Playstation, Wii, and more!.\n\nRelax with our Non-Stop Video Playlists!:\n\n▼ Our Most Popular Videos ▼\nhttp://bit.ly/MostPopular4KVideos\n\n▼ Beautiful Nature in 4K ▼\nhttp://bit.ly/BeautifulNature-Playlist\n\n▼ Aquariums in 4K ▼\n http://bit.ly/Relaxing4KAquariums\n\n▼ The Most Beautiful Landscapes ▼ \nhttp://bit.ly/Landscapes-Playlist\n\n▼  Cute Animals and Relaxing Music ▼ \n http://bit.ly/CuteAnimals-Playlist\n\n▼ HDR videos ▼\n http://bit.ly/hdr4k\n\n▼Follow us on Facebook and Instagram▼\nhttps://www.facebook.com/BaLuRelaxingNature/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/balurelaxingnature/\n\n\nCopyright:\nAll the footage was recorded, edited and color corrected by us, we don't use stock footage in our channel, our footage is 100% Original :)\nVideo Footage Copyright exclusively belongs to Balu Relaxing Nature. \nAny attempt to re-upload our footage on youtube will be detected and reported.\n\nTechnical Details:\nCamera Used: Sony Alpha 1 or a1. Sony 70-200mm lens.\nOriginal BT2020 HLG footage converted to ST.2084.\nEdited in HDR BT2020 ST.2084 PQ 1000nits.\nColor grading and Color correction in Davinci Resolve.\nHDR Mastering Monitor: Apple Pro Display XDR at 1000 nits.\n\nWhat is HDR?:\nIf you watch this video on an HDR compatible device like an Oled TV, or a mobile phone like the Samsung S8 S9 and iPhone X, you will be able to see a High Dynamic Range version of the video. HDR basically means better contrast, greater brightness levels and a wider color palette. The idea is that your eyes can perceive brighter whites and darker blacks – greater dynamism – than traditional TVs have been able to display.\n\nRelated Hashtags:\n#4K #HDR #Nature",
  "descriptionHtml": "Enjoy the peaceful and colorful nature views in incredible REAL 4K HDR 60FPS. Relax with beautiful birds like Toucans, Macaws, Flamingos and more!..  Music for relaxation, meditation, yoga, study. Sit back, relax and enjoy :)\n\nHelping you Relax with Stunning Nature in 4K, subscribe for more!:\n▷ <a href=\"http://bit.ly/Subscribe-Balu\">bit.ly/Subscribe-Balu</a>\n🔔Be sure to ring the bell to get EVERY new video notification! 🔔\n\nOur 4k Videos are great as a TV Screensaver for the living room, office, lounge, waiting room, Spa, Restaurant, etc. Play it in your Oled TV like the samsung S95B, LG c2, Smart TV, Roku, Apple tv, Chromecast, Xbox, Playstation, Wii, and more!.\n\nRelax with our Non-Stop Video Playlists!:\n\n▼ Our Most Popular Videos ▼\n<a href=\"http://bit.ly/MostPopular4KVideos\">bit.ly/MostPopular4KVideos</a>\n\n▼ Beautiful Nature in 4K ▼\n<a href=\"http://bit.ly/BeautifulNature-Playlist\">bit.ly/BeautifulNature-Playlist</a>\n\n▼ Aquariums in 4K ▼\n <a href=\"http://bit.ly/Relaxing4KAquariums\">bit.ly/Relaxing4KAquariums</a>\n\n▼ The Most Beautiful Landscapes ▼ \n<a href=\"http://bit.ly/Landscapes-Playlist\">bit.ly/Landscapes-Playlist</a>\n\n▼  Cute Animals and Relaxing Music ▼ \n <a href=\"http://bit.ly/CuteAnimals-Playlist\">bit.ly/CuteAnimals-Playlist</a>\n\n▼ HDR videos ▼\n <a href=\"http://bit.ly/hdr4k\">bit.ly/hdr4k</a>\n\n▼Follow us on Facebook and Instagram▼\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BaLuRelaxingNature/\">www.facebook.com/BaLuRelaxingNature/</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/balurelaxingnature/\">www.instagram.com/balurelaxingnature/</a>\n\n\nCopyright:\nAll the footage was recorded, edited and color corrected by us, we don&#39;t use stock footage in our channel, our footage is 100% Original :)\nVideo Footage Copyright exclusively belongs to Balu Relaxing Nature. \nAny attempt to re-upload our footage on youtube will be detected and reported.\n\nTechnical Details:\nCamera Used: Sony Alpha 1 or a1. Sony 70-200mm lens.\nOriginal BT2020 HLG footage converted to ST.2084.\nEdited in HDR BT2020 ST.2084 PQ 1000nits.\nColor grading and Color correction in Davinci Resolve.\nHDR Mastering Monitor: Apple Pro Display XDR at 1000 nits.\n\nWhat is HDR?:\nIf you watch this video on an HDR compatible device like an Oled TV, or a mobile phone like the Samsung S8 S9 and iPhone X, you will be able to see a High Dynamic Range version of the video. HDR basically means better contrast, greater brightness levels and a wider color palette. The idea is that your eyes can perceive brighter whites and darker blacks – greater dynamism – than traditional TVs have been able to display.\n\nRelated Hashtags:\n<a href=\"/hashtag/4k\">#4K</a> <a href=\"/hashtag/hdr\">#HDR</a> <a href=\"/hashtag/nature\">#Nature</a>",
